@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Introduction to Microsoft Azure";
    ViewData["ActiveMenu"] = "AzureDevOps";
}

<div class="container py-4">
    <p class="text-center lead">Microsoft Azure is a comprehensive cloud computing platform that provides a wide range of services for building, deploying, and managing applications.</p>
    <hr />

    <!-- Introduction to Azure -->
    <div class="mt-4">
        <h2 class="text-primary">What is Microsoft Azure?</h2>
        <p>
            Microsoft Azure is a cloud computing platform offering services such as virtual machines, databases, AI solutions, and security tools. It enables businesses to innovate and scale efficiently by leveraging cloud resources.
        </p>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/azure-intro.jpg" alt="Microsoft Azure Overview" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Azure provides a secure and scalable cloud environment for various applications.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Key Features of Azure -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-success">Key Features of Microsoft Azure</h2>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Scalability:</strong> Azure allows businesses to scale their resources dynamically based on demand.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Security & Compliance:</strong> Azure follows industry standards and regulations to ensure secure operations.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>AI & Machine Learning:</strong> Built-in AI tools help businesses enhance their applications with intelligent capabilities.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Hybrid Cloud Capabilities:</strong> Azure supports hybrid cloud environments for seamless data and application management.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Cost Management:</strong> Azure provides cost optimization tools to manage cloud expenses effectively.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/azure-features.jpg" alt="Azure Features" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Azure offers a wide range of features to meet business and developer needs.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Azure Services -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-warning">Popular Azure Services</h2>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Azure Virtual Machines:</strong> Deploy and manage scalable virtual servers.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Azure App Services:</strong> Host web applications with built-in security and scalability.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Azure SQL Database:</strong> Managed relational database service for storing and analyzing data.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS):</strong> Simplified Kubernetes management for containerized applications.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Azure DevOps:</strong> A suite of tools for CI/CD, version control, and agile development.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/azure-services.jpg" alt="Azure Services" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Azure services empower businesses to build, deploy, and manage applications seamlessly.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Conclusion -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-info">Conclusion</h2>
        <p>
            Microsoft Azure is a powerful cloud platform offering a diverse range of services to help businesses grow and innovate. With its scalability, security, and extensive service offerings, Azure is a preferred choice for cloud computing.
        </p>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/azure-future.jpg" alt="Future of Azure" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Azure continues to evolve, shaping the future of cloud computing.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>